Add a Mailu OAuth2 issuer for native mail clients with PKCE, selectable protocol scopes, refreshable access, and per-user revocation. Rotated refresh-token reuse revokes its grant family; refresh tokens have configurable absolute and idle lifetimes. OAUTHBEARER and XOAUTH2 are available for IMAP, SMTP submission, POP3, and ManageSieve. The Thunderbird provider add-on recognizes every Mailu hostname and can update itself from a self-hosted update manifest. Authorized mail apps show their detected client name, last token refresh, and last connection address.
